<title>USA: Equity Residential sells 5 million shares.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential sells 5 million shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Tuesday it sold five million common shares through Merrill Lynch &amp; Co at $44.06 a share and granted an over-allotment option of an additional 750,000 shares.</p>
<p>The proceeds, totaling $220.3 million, will be used to reduce the company's unsecured line of credit and for the acquisition of additonal multi-family properties, the company said.</p>
<p>Shares of Equity Residential, a real estate investment trust, traded down 3/4 at 45-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
